{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55652","headline":"永明山居诗（六十九首） 五十 · 延寿","name":"永明山居诗（六十九首） 五十","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"得理元来行自成，万般情断一心冥。\n樵人不到缘山僻，游客难逢爲岳灵。\n食蘖苦心何日就，看花醉眼几时醒。\n索然身外无余物，云满前山水满瓶。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"延寿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55652.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55652","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}